WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:03.002
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.086 --> 00:04.087
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:04.170 --> 00:06.297
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:06.381 --> 00:08.174
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:08.258 --> 00:11.010
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.094 --> 00:13.513
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.596 --> 00:15.306
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.390 --> 00:17.684
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.767 --> 00:19.352
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.563
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.646 --> 00:23.189
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.273 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.693
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.776 --> 00:27.861
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.944 --> 00:29.696
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.779 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.408
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.491 --> 00:37.287
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:16.201 --> 01:17.827
What are you doing, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，你在做什么？

01:17.911 --> 01:20.663
Just making sure
the Krabby Patty formula
is safe.
只是确定
蟹黄饼配方
是安全的。

01:20.747 --> 01:23.833
Plankton hasn't tried to steal
the formula in over a month.
浮游生物并没有试图偷窃
一个多月内的公式。

01:23.917 --> 01:26.211
He must be planning
something big.
他一定是在计划
一些大事。

01:26.294 --> 01:27.754
Hello.
你好。

01:27.837 --> 01:30.006
One of you will have to
volunteer for some extra work.
你们中的一个人必须
自愿做一些额外的工作。

01:30.089 --> 01:31.591
Goodbye.
再见。

01:31.674 --> 01:34.761
I was just gonna ask if someone
could spy on Plankton.
我只是想问是否有人
可以监视浮游生物。

01:34.844 --> 01:37.639
Spy?
间谍？

01:37.722 --> 01:41.476
Ooh!
哦！

01:44.687 --> 01:47.232
Hey, SpongeBob, I can see you
through this straw.
嘿，海绵宝宝，我能看到你
通过这根稻草。

01:47.315 --> 01:50.068
Patrick, I'm gonna be a spy!
帕特里克，我要成为一名间谍！

01:50.151 --> 01:51.236
You're a spy?
你是间谍？

01:51.319 --> 01:52.946
I want to be a spy, too!
我也想当间谍！

01:53.029 --> 01:54.614
Shh, OK, OK.
嘘，好吧，好吧。

01:54.697 --> 01:56.074
You can be a spy.
你可以成为一名间谍。

01:56.157 --> 01:57.450
Just be quiet.
安静点。

01:57.534 --> 01:58.952
Hooray!
万岁！

01:59.035 --> 02:00.954
We're spy buddies!
我们是间谍伙伴！

02:01.037 --> 02:02.956
Shh.
嘘。

02:03.039 --> 02:04.707
: Spy buddies.
: 间谍伙伴。

02:04.791 --> 02:07.126
Your instructions are on
this Krabby Patty, but remember
您的指示已开启
这个蟹肉饼，但记住

02:07.210 --> 02:11.548
the fate of the Krusty Krab
rests in your hands, SpongeBob.
蟹堡王的命运
一切都在你的手中，海绵宝宝。

02:11.631 --> 02:13.716
In my hands.
在我手中。

02:13.800 --> 02:14.717
Ooh.
哦。

02:14.801 --> 02:16.803
Ooh.
哦。

02:19.931 --> 02:21.474
Krabs: Your mission,
if you choose to accept it
蟹蟹：你的使命，
如果你选择接受

02:21.558 --> 02:23.810
is to discover
what Plankton's up to.
是去发现
浮游生物在做什么。

02:23.893 --> 02:25.770
Don't let him out of your sight.
别让他离开你的视线。

02:25.854 --> 02:28.481
You'll need to rustle up
some spy gadgets.
你需要振作起来
一些间谍小工具。

02:28.565 --> 02:30.650
If you don't accept it,
you're fired.
如果你不接受的话
你被解雇了。

02:30.733 --> 02:33.027
This patty will self-destruct
in 10 seconds.
这个肉饼会自毁
10 秒后。

02:36.531 --> 02:37.657
Get rid of it.
摆脱它。

02:37.740 --> 02:43.580
Get rid of it, Patrick.
摆脱它，帕特里克。

02:43.663 --> 02:48.126
That's gonna leave a mark.
那会留下痕迹的

02:48.209 --> 02:49.294
Hi, Sandy.
嗨，桑迪。

02:49.377 --> 02:50.920
Hey, SpongeBob, Patrick.
嘿，海绵宝宝，帕特里克。

02:51.004 --> 02:52.171
What y'all doin'?
你们都在做什么？

02:52.255 --> 02:54.090
Do you know anything about
spying, Sandy?
你知道什么吗
间谍，桑迪？

02:54.173 --> 02:57.176
Well, I know you need
a lot of crazy gadgets,
like jet packs
嗯，我知道你需要
很多疯狂的小玩意，
像喷气背包

02:57.260 --> 03:00.513
and laser-equipped
Bermuda shorts
with walkie-talkies.
并配备激光
百慕大短裤
与对讲机。

03:00.597 --> 03:02.390
Man: 10-4, good buddy.
男：10-4，好哥们。

03:02.473 --> 03:06.144
Cameras that fit
up your nose, high-powered
magnifying glasses...
适合的相机
抬起你的鼻子，高能
放大镜...

03:07.562 --> 03:12.066
And my favorite,
the knockout ray.
还有我最喜欢的，
淘汰射线。

03:14.110 --> 03:15.403
Wow, Sandy.
哇，桑迪。

03:15.486 --> 03:18.114
With these gadgets, Patrick
and I will be great spies.
有了这些小玩意，帕特里克
我会成为伟大的间谍。

03:19.866 --> 03:23.036
I wouldn't trust you two
with any of this stuff.
我不会相信你们两个
与任何这些东西。

03:23.953 --> 03:26.414
What do we do now, Patrick?
我们现在该怎么办，帕特里克？

03:30.668 --> 03:33.504
What's he doing now?
他现在在做什么？

03:33.588 --> 03:34.589
Nothing yet.
还什么都没有。

03:34.672 --> 03:36.633
Wait, wait, he's...
等等，等等，他...

03:36.716 --> 03:38.176
buying baby clothes?
买婴儿衣服？

03:38.259 --> 03:41.512
We got to get closer.
我们必须靠近一点。

03:41.596 --> 03:43.932
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

03:44.015 --> 03:47.185
Do you have anything
in a size negative five?
你有什么吗
尺寸为负五？

03:48.353 --> 03:49.729
Uh, sorry, bud.
呃，抱歉，伙计。

03:49.812 --> 03:51.064
That's as small as they come.
这和他们来的一样小。

03:53.024 --> 03:56.319
Wow, Plankton has to
buy baby clothes?
哇，浮游生物必须
买婴儿衣服吗？

03:56.402 --> 04:01.074
How embarrassing.
多么尴尬啊。

04:01.157 --> 04:02.659
SpongeBob to Krabs.
从海绵宝宝到蟹蟹。

04:02.742 --> 04:03.910
Come in, Krabs.
进来吧，蟹蟹。

04:03.993 --> 04:04.911
Krabs here.
这里有螃蟹。

04:04.994 --> 04:06.120
Go ahead.
前进。

04:06.204 --> 04:07.205
Plankton just bought
some baby clothes.
刚买的浮游生物
一些婴儿衣服。

04:07.288 --> 04:08.790
Baby clothes?
婴儿衣服？

04:08.873 --> 04:09.749
Hm.
嗯。

04:09.832 --> 04:10.917
What's he doing now?
他现在在做什么？

04:11.000 --> 04:12.585
Hold on.
坚持，稍等。

04:12.669 --> 04:13.920
He's buying...
他要买...

04:14.003 --> 04:15.129
Yeah, yeah?
是啊是啊？

04:15.213 --> 04:18.424
A stamp.
一张邮票。

04:18.508 --> 04:19.634
A stamp.
一张邮票。

04:19.717 --> 04:22.220
This is the most
elaborate scheme ever.
这是最
精心设计的计划。

04:22.303 --> 04:25.807
Keep on him, SpongeBob.
继续追随他，海绵宝宝。

04:25.890 --> 04:29.227
We're right behind him,
and he has no idea.
我们就在他身后
他不知道。

04:35.650 --> 04:37.276
Would you stop making
all that racket?
你能停止做吗
那些喧闹？

04:38.695 --> 04:40.238
What's he doing now?
他现在在做什么？

04:40.321 --> 04:45.159
I can't tell.
我不知道。

04:45.243 --> 04:48.246
Phew, gosh, it's hot.
唷，天哪，好热。

04:50.289 --> 04:51.541
He's getting away.
他要离开了。

04:51.624 --> 04:53.584
Quick, Patrick,
use the jet pack.
快点，帕特里克，
使用喷气背包。

04:53.668 --> 04:57.213
Can do.
可以做。

05:01.175 --> 05:03.011
Phew.
唷。

05:03.094 --> 05:04.095
Huh?
啊？

05:17.400 --> 05:21.154
Boy, it was lucky
the sidewalk broke our fall.
男孩，真幸运
人行道阻止了我们的跌倒。

05:21.237 --> 05:22.280
But we lost Plankton.
但我们失去了浮游生物。

05:22.363 --> 05:27.076
To the spy-mobile.
到间谍车。

05:27.160 --> 05:28.661
Hm.
嗯。

05:28.745 --> 05:31.372
Mines, oil slick,
smoke screen, shield.
矿山、浮油、
烟幕，盾牌。

05:31.456 --> 05:32.540
Patrick: Self-destruct.
帕特里克：自毁。

05:41.758 --> 05:44.552
There's a call coming through
on my "pants-o-phone."
有电话打过来
在我的“裤子手机”上。

05:44.635 --> 05:46.054
Krabs: Krabs to agent SpongeBob.
蟹老板：蟹老板对海绵宝宝特工。

05:46.137 --> 05:47.346
Come in, SpongeBob.
进来吧，海绵宝宝。

05:47.430 --> 05:48.681
It's for you.
这是给你的。

05:48.765 --> 05:50.016
Agent SpongeBob here.
海绵宝宝特工在这里。

05:50.099 --> 05:51.559
Krabs: Have you found out
what Plankton's up to?
蟹蟹：你发现了吗？
浮游生物在做什么？

05:51.642 --> 05:53.686
I'm afraid
we lost him, Mr. Krabs.
我害怕
我们失去了他，蟹老板。

05:53.770 --> 05:55.104
Well, find him, lad.
好吧，找到他，小伙子。

05:55.188 --> 05:56.731
I'm not paying you
to goof off with Patrick.
我不付钱给你
和帕特里克偷懒。

05:56.814 --> 05:58.775
You're not paying me
at all, Mr. Krabs.
你不付钱给我
无论如何，蟹老板。

05:58.858 --> 06:01.194
Exactly, so get to work!
没错，所以开始工作吧！

06:02.862 --> 06:06.699
Operator: If you'd like to make
a call, please deposit 25 cents.
接线员：如果您愿意的话
打电话，请存25美分。

06:11.329 --> 06:13.039
SpongeBob: OK, Patrick,
we're in position.
海绵宝宝：好的，帕特里克，
我们已就位。

06:13.122 --> 06:14.499
Now, how do we get inside?
现在，我们如何进去？

06:14.582 --> 06:16.751
I think the front door's open.
我认为前门是开着的。

06:16.834 --> 06:19.837
Spies don't use
the front door, Patrick.
间谍不使用
前门，帕特里克。

06:19.921 --> 06:23.382
We've got to figure out
a complicated way to get inside.
我们必须弄清楚
进入内部的方法很复杂。

06:23.466 --> 06:30.056
This looks like a job
for Patrick star laser pants.
这看起来像是一份工作
帕特里克星激光裤。

06:30.139 --> 06:31.057
Ooh.
哦。

06:36.854 --> 06:38.481
Good work, Patrick.
干得好，帕特里克。

06:38.564 --> 06:40.983
Now, it's my turn.
现在，轮到我了。

06:46.656 --> 06:49.075
I thought you were holding
the rope.
我以为你拿着
绳子。

06:49.158 --> 06:49.909
I am.
我是。

06:49.992 --> 06:51.369
You need to be quiet.
你需要保持安静。

06:51.452 --> 06:52.703
We're on a secret mission.
我们正在执行一项秘密任务。

06:52.787 --> 06:55.206
Plankton: Secret mission, Eh?
浮游生物：秘密任务，嗯？

06:56.499 --> 06:58.960
Don't you think
I know what you're up to?
你不觉得
我知道你在做什么？

06:59.043 --> 07:03.047
You want to eat at
the Chum Bucket without
your boss knowing.
你想吃在
没有的密友桶
你的老板知道。

07:03.131 --> 07:05.758
Karen, we've got a customer.
凯伦，我们有一位顾客。

07:05.842 --> 07:10.263
I'll let you two
look over the menu.
我让你们两个
查看菜单。

07:10.346 --> 07:12.598
SpongeBob, I have to go.
海绵宝宝，我得走了。

07:12.682 --> 07:14.100
Oh, can't you go later?
哦，你不能晚点走吗？

07:15.726 --> 07:18.146
My laser pants
aren't working right.
我的激光裤
工作不正常。

07:21.607 --> 07:25.278
Can I interest you in
a raspberry iced tea?
我可以让你感兴趣吗
覆盆子冰茶？

07:25.361 --> 07:26.529
No, thanks.
不，谢谢。

07:26.612 --> 07:27.780
Or perhaps a bran muffin?
或者也许是麸皮松饼？

07:29.448 --> 07:31.492
SpongeBob, I have to go now.
海绵宝宝，我得走了。

07:31.576 --> 07:32.702
Prune Danish?
修剪丹麦语？

07:33.828 --> 07:34.829
What the...?
什么……？

07:50.595 --> 07:52.889
Destroy my lab, will you, Krabs?
毁掉我的实验室，好吗，蟹蟹？

07:52.972 --> 07:58.311
Well, if it's war you want,
it's war you'll get!
好吧，如果你想要战争，
你会得到战争！

08:00.771 --> 08:06.152
Is it dark, or have I put off
my cataract surgery too long?
天黑了吗，还是我推迟了
我的白内障手术时间太长了吗？

08:06.235 --> 08:09.739
No, Mr. Krabs,
it's that time of the month.
不，蟹老板先生，
现在是每个月的这个时候。

08:09.822 --> 08:11.532
Krabs: Merciful Neptune!
蟹蟹：仁慈的海王星！

08:11.616 --> 08:13.492
Man your battle stations.
管理你的战斗站。

08:13.576 --> 08:14.619
I'm on it.
我正在做。

08:23.753 --> 08:25.588
Bring it on, Plankton.
加油吧，浮游生物。

08:25.671 --> 08:27.506
Plankton: Oh, I will.
浮游生物：哦，我会的。

08:27.590 --> 08:33.888
We'll see if you have
a customer left after
I pump up the volume.
我们会看看你是否有
一位顾客离开后
我把音量调大。

08:38.434 --> 08:39.936
Oh, brother.
哦，兄弟。

08:40.019 --> 08:42.939
I hated the real version
of this song.
我讨厌真实版本
这首歌的。

08:46.609 --> 08:49.028
He's driving me customers away.
他正在赶走我的顾客。

08:49.111 --> 08:52.740
All right, Plankton,
you want my customers so badly?
好吧，浮游生物，
你这么想要我的顾客吗？

08:52.823 --> 08:56.744
You can have 'em.
你可以拥有它们。

08:56.827 --> 09:01.582
Do your worst, Krabs!
蟹蟹们，尽你所能吧！

09:01.666 --> 09:03.584
I hate my job.
我讨厌我的工作。

09:03.668 --> 09:05.503
It's up to you and me, buddy.
这取决于你和我，伙计。

09:05.586 --> 09:06.671
Abandon ship.
弃船。

09:15.930 --> 09:20.393
Pointy-headed projectile
on the port side.
尖头弹丸
在左舷。

09:30.653 --> 09:33.364
No!
不！

09:37.785 --> 09:39.370
I win!
我赢了！

09:39.453 --> 09:41.372
I always win!
我总是赢！

09:41.455 --> 09:44.834
Not to rain on
your parade or anything,
but you always lose.
不让下雨
你的游行或者其他什么，
但你总是会输。

09:44.917 --> 09:49.630
No, SpongeBob, I always win.
不，海绵宝宝，我总是赢。

09:50.798 --> 09:51.882
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

09:51.966 --> 09:54.760
That's right.
这是正确的。

09:54.844 --> 09:56.971
I stole me own formula.
我偷了我自己的配方。

09:57.054 --> 09:59.890
But if you're Mr. Krabs,
then who's...?
但如果你是蟹老板
那么谁是...？

09:59.974 --> 10:01.726
SpongeBob: Mr. Krabs is a robot!
海绵宝宝：蟹老板是一个机器人！

10:01.809 --> 10:03.019
No, you idiot.
不，你这个白痴。

10:03.102 --> 10:04.895
SpongeBob: Plankton?
海绵宝宝：浮游生物？

10:04.979 --> 10:06.897
What the barnacles
is going on here?
什么是藤壶
这是怎么回事？

10:06.981 --> 10:08.357
You see, we had a bet.
你看，我们打赌了。

10:08.441 --> 10:10.192
Plankton's been trying
for 20 years
浮游生物一直在努力
20年来

10:10.276 --> 10:12.945
to steal the formula,
and he's never done it.
窃取公式，
但他从来没有这样做过。

10:13.029 --> 10:16.907
I almost had it 37 times,
and you know it.
我差点就经历了37次
你知道的。

10:16.991 --> 10:19.160
Tell it to the claw, sister.
告诉爪子吧，姐姐。

10:19.243 --> 10:21.829
Last time he failed,
we made a bet.
上次他失败了，
我们打赌。

10:23.956 --> 10:25.583
You can't beat me, Plankton.
你打不过我，浮游生物。

10:25.666 --> 10:26.584
I always win.
我总是赢。

10:29.003 --> 10:30.963
You've got the easy part.
你已经完成了简单的部分。

10:31.047 --> 10:33.883
I'd like to see you do  my  job.
我希望看到你完成我的工作。

10:33.966 --> 10:35.468
Oh, yeah, right.
哦，是的，没错。

10:35.551 --> 10:38.637
If I was you, I could steal
the formula on me first try.
如果我是你，我就可以偷东西
我先尝试一下公式。

10:38.721 --> 10:40.056
Hah!
哈！

10:40.139 --> 10:41.724
The usual wager?
平常的赌注？

10:41.807 --> 10:43.809
You're on.
你开始了。

10:43.893 --> 10:47.188
So, through a series of events
far too elaborate
to go into right now
于是，通过一系列的事件
过于复杂
现在就进入

10:47.271 --> 10:49.607
we flawlessly assumed
each other's lives
我们完美地假设
彼此的生活

10:49.690 --> 10:54.820
and I beat Plankton
at his own game, and destroyed
his place of business.
我打败了浮游生物
在他自己的游戏中，并摧毁了
他的营业地点。

10:56.030 --> 10:57.823
Now pay up.
现在付钱吧。

10:57.907 --> 10:59.658
Here you go, Eugene.
给你，尤金。

10:59.742 --> 11:00.993
One dollar.
一美元。

11:01.077 --> 11:04.872
Not so fast.
没那么快。

11:04.955 --> 11:05.873
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

11:05.956 --> 11:07.291
Then who are you?
那你是谁？

11:07.375 --> 11:09.001
I'm not...
我不是...

11:09.085 --> 11:11.629
...wearing a disguise.
……乔装打扮。

11:11.712 --> 11:17.468
Hm, if he's Squidward,
then you must be... Sandy?
嗯，如果他是章鱼哥，
那你一定是……桑迪？

11:17.551 --> 11:19.845
Whoops, wrong outfit.
哎呀，穿错衣服了。

11:20.971 --> 11:22.014
You're me.
你就是我。

11:22.098 --> 11:23.307
Then I must be...
那我一定是...

11:23.391 --> 11:24.725
Patrick!
帕特里克！

11:24.809 --> 11:25.976
Nah, I'm just kidding.
不，我只是开玩笑。

11:26.060 --> 11:27.978
I really am Patrick.
我真的是帕特里克。

11:31.190 --> 11:32.692
Good one, Patrick.
好一个，帕特里克。

11:36.362 --> 11:38.948
There's just one thing
I don't understand.
只有一件事
我不明白。

11:39.031 --> 11:40.574
What's that, laddie?
那是什么，小伙子？

11:40.658 --> 11:41.575
That.
那。

11:54.547 --> 11:57.550
Man: Boat smarts,
with Mrs. Puff.
男人：船聪明，
和普芙夫人。

11:57.633 --> 12:00.678
This driving safety film
is brought to you
by "COBBUTKSBSPOTRAOOBAT"
这部行车安全片
给你带来了
通过“COBBUTKSBSPOTRAOOBAT”

12:00.761 --> 12:03.305
citizens of Bikini Bottom united
to keep SpongeBob SquarePants
比基尼泳滩的公民团结起来
保留海绵宝宝

12:03.389 --> 12:05.099
off the road and out
of boats all together.
离开道路并出去
的船都在一起。

12:05.182 --> 12:06.725
Good day, future motorists.
美好的一天，未来的驾车者。

12:06.809 --> 12:09.186
I'm Mrs. Puff, state accredited
driving instructor.
我是帕夫夫人，获得国家认可
驾驶教练。

12:09.270 --> 12:14.191
Today, we'll be discussing
the differences between
a driver with boat smarts...
今天我们要讨论的是
之间的差异
一个有船智慧的司机......

12:14.275 --> 12:17.069
Ripping good day for
a spot of driving.
撕裂美好的一天
一个开车的地方。

12:17.153 --> 12:19.447
...and a driver
without boat smarts.
...还有一名司机
没有船的智慧。

12:19.530 --> 12:23.993
Hey, Squidward, look what
I can do with my feet!
嘿，章鱼哥，看什么
我用脚也能做到！

12:25.369 --> 12:27.705
Let's see some examples,
shall we?
让我们看一些例子，
我们可以吗？

12:27.788 --> 12:29.081
Tire pressure.
轮胎压力。

12:29.165 --> 12:31.959
Before you can even think
about boating
在你能思考之前
关于划船

12:32.042 --> 12:38.466
the boater who uses boat smarts
always fills his tires
to the appropriate level
使用船舶智能的划船者
总是给他的轮胎加油
到适当的水平

12:38.549 --> 12:43.846
while this driver pays
no heed to boat smarts.
当这位司机付钱时
不关心船的智慧。

12:52.104 --> 12:54.064
Mrs. Puff: Buckling up.
普夫夫人：系好安全带。

12:54.148 --> 12:58.861
As demonstrated by this driver,
he has enough boat smarts
to use his seatbelt
正如这位司机所证明的那样，
他有足够的船智慧
使用安全带

12:58.944 --> 13:04.492
and avoid a serious casualty
as a result of a collision.
并避免严重伤亡
由于碰撞。

13:04.575 --> 13:07.786
Notice how he comes gently
to a stop sign.
注意他是如何温柔地过来的
到停车标志。

13:07.870 --> 13:12.124
Now, this driver
with no regard for safety...
现在这位司机
不顾安全...

13:17.713 --> 13:22.051
Mrs. Puff: Well, at least he had
his seat belt on.
普夫夫人：嗯，至少他有
他系好安全带。

13:27.473 --> 13:29.266
Mrs. Puff: Adjusting
your mirrors.
泡芙夫人：调整中
你的镜子。

13:29.350 --> 13:32.978
What's our boat smarts
boater up to now?
我们的船有什么智能
划船到现在？

13:33.062 --> 13:34.980
You guessed it.
你猜对了。

13:35.064 --> 13:40.194
He's adjusting his mirror
before he begins boating,
unlike this degenerate boater.
他正在调整镜子
在他开始划船之前，
不像这个堕落的船夫。

13:41.946 --> 13:44.365
Ah, perfect.
啊，完美。

13:44.448 --> 13:46.992
Hey, use your mirrors, fool.
嘿，用你的镜子，傻瓜。

13:47.076 --> 13:48.160
Mirrors?
镜子？

13:48.244 --> 13:49.286
Oh, that reminds me.
哦，这让我想起了。

13:49.370 --> 13:51.121
I haven't adjusted this one yet.
这个我还没有调整过。

13:51.205 --> 13:54.166
Ah, can't see.
啊，看不到。

13:54.250 --> 13:57.545
Oh!
哦！

14:05.094 --> 14:06.554
Ow.
噢。

14:06.637 --> 14:10.683
Finally, and most importantly,
a driver with boat smarts
最后，也是最重要的一点是，
有船智慧的司机

14:10.766 --> 14:15.604
always pays attention
to his surroundings,
and avoids distractions.
总是关注
对他的周围环境，
并避免分心。

14:15.688 --> 14:21.402
Notice how this driver's eyes
are locked firmly on the road.
注意这位司机的眼睛
被牢牢锁在路上。

14:21.485 --> 14:23.862
And here we have the epitome
of a driver
这里我们有一个缩影
一个司机的

14:23.946 --> 14:30.119
who is carelessly
distracting himself from
the road and safety.
谁不小心
分散自己的注意力
道路和安全。

14:46.927 --> 14:49.471
Jerk!
混蛋！

14:49.555 --> 14:52.057
Hi there!
你好呀！

14:52.141 --> 14:53.976
Help, lunatic driver!
救命啊，疯狂的司机！

14:55.185 --> 14:57.229
How's it going?
怎么样了？

15:00.065 --> 15:04.028
Mrs. Puff: SpongeBob, I mean,
a boater without boat smarts
泡芙夫人：海绵宝宝，我是说，
没有划船智慧的划船者

15:04.111 --> 15:07.948
shows contempt for
his boater brethren and the law.
表示蔑视
他的船夫兄弟和法律。

15:08.032 --> 15:10.159
SpongeBob: ♪ La, la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

15:10.242 --> 15:13.078
Whee!
哎哟！

15:13.162 --> 15:14.872
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

15:14.955 --> 15:15.914
Hi, Mrs. Puff.
嗨，普芙女士。

15:27.635 --> 15:30.971
Looks like you guys
forgot your boat smarts.
看起来像你们
忘记了你的船智慧。

15:36.644 --> 15:38.312
Mrs. Puff: Never mind.
普芙夫人：没关系。

15:54.286 --> 15:55.913
Exciting meeting, Mr. Krabs?
令人兴奋的会面吗，蟹老板？

15:55.996 --> 15:57.748
Oh, you bet you, SpongeBob.
噢，你敢打赌，海绵宝宝。

15:57.831 --> 15:59.291
Listen to this.
听听这个。

15:59.375 --> 16:01.585
Individuation of the end user
will substantially broaden
最终用户的个性化
将大幅拓宽

16:01.669 --> 16:03.629
the probability of multiple
subsequent visits
多重的概率
随后的访问

16:03.712 --> 16:06.215
generating an inverse
negative revenue margin
生成逆
负收入利润率

16:06.298 --> 16:07.841
of 3/4 of
1/2 of one percent.
的 3/4
百分之一的 1/2。

16:07.925 --> 16:11.553
Meaning, if you call
the customers by their name
意思是，如果你打电话
顾客的名字

16:11.637 --> 16:14.014
they keep coming back to spend
more of their greenbacks
他们不断回来消费
更多的美元

16:14.098 --> 16:18.977
so I want you two to learn
the names of every customer.
所以我想让你们两个学习
每个顾客的名字。

16:19.061 --> 16:22.898
I have an important life
to live, and it doesn't include
chattering with you two ninnies.
我有重要的人生
生活，它不包括
和你们两个傻瓜聊天。

16:22.981 --> 16:28.362
I thought you might say that,
so I decided to turn this
into a contest.
我以为你可能会这么说
所以我决定改变这个
参加比赛。

16:28.445 --> 16:32.908
The employee who learns
more names wins this.
学习的员工
更多的名字会赢得胜利。

16:32.991 --> 16:39.790
A tropical getaway,
on the triple-decker Con-Huge-Co
cruise liner.
热带度假胜地，
在三层甲板 Con-Huge-Co 上
游轮。

16:39.873 --> 16:45.587
Sunbathing, Parcheesi,
ballroom dancing.
日光浴，帕奇西，
交际舞。

16:46.588 --> 16:50.008
This is gonna be so easy.
这会很容易。

16:50.092 --> 16:53.721
SpongeBob doesn't realize that
I'm the face of the Krusty Krab.
海绵宝宝并没有意识到这一点
我是蟹堡王的代言人。

16:53.804 --> 16:56.932
While he's isolated
in the kitchen all day
当他被孤立时
整天在厨房里

16:57.015 --> 17:01.562
I've been out here, building
a rapport with the customer.
我一直在这里，建造
与客户的融洽关系。

17:01.645 --> 17:03.188
Hello.
你好。

17:03.272 --> 17:05.691
May I get you
anything else, miss?
我可以得到你吗
还有什么吗，小姐？

17:05.774 --> 17:08.193
Since when do you give
two shrimps about
customer service
从什么时候开始你给
两只虾大约
客户服务

17:08.277 --> 17:09.611
Mister Grouchy Squid Guy?
脾气暴躁的乌贼男先生？

17:09.695 --> 17:10.863
SpongeBob: Hi, Sally.
海绵宝宝：嗨，莎莉。

17:10.946 --> 17:11.905
Hi, Sadie.
嗨，萨迪。

17:11.989 --> 17:13.198
Hi, Shoobie.
嗨，舒比。

17:13.282 --> 17:14.950
How does SpongeBob
know all these names?
海绵宝宝是怎样做的
知道所有这些名字吗？

17:15.033 --> 17:16.744
Right back at you, Lenny.
就在你身边，莱尼。

17:16.827 --> 17:20.122
Hey, SpongeBob, could you take
a look at the cash register?
嘿，海绵宝宝，你能接受吗
看一下收银机？

17:20.205 --> 17:21.206
I think it's broken.
我认为它坏了。

17:21.290 --> 17:22.916
Oh, sure, Squidward.
哦，当然，章鱼哥。

17:23.000 --> 17:25.461
I think you might need
a closer look.
我想你可能需要
仔细看看。

17:25.544 --> 17:28.047
Let me give you a hand.
让我帮你。

17:28.130 --> 17:30.883
I can't see anything
in here, Squidward.
我什么也看不见
在这里，章鱼哥。

17:30.966 --> 17:32.176
Keep looking, SpongeBob.
继续寻找，海绵宝宝。

17:32.259 --> 17:33.427
Keep on looking.
继续寻找。

17:33.510 --> 17:36.847
So, what's your name?
那么，你叫什么名字？

17:36.930 --> 17:38.849
Hi, Thaddeus.
嗨，撒迪厄斯。

17:38.932 --> 17:40.768
Goodbye, SpongeBob.
再见，海绵宝宝。

17:40.851 --> 17:44.563
That should buy me enough time
to win that cruise.
这应该能为我赢得足够的时间
赢得那次巡航。

17:44.646 --> 17:45.856
Good day, young sir.
美好的一天，年轻的先生。

17:45.939 --> 17:46.857
My name is...
我的名字是...

17:46.940 --> 17:47.900
Gus!
格斯！

17:47.983 --> 17:49.234
He's right.
他是对的。

17:49.318 --> 17:51.779
This guy's so good,
you should give him a prize.
这人真好
你应该给他一个奖品。

17:51.862 --> 17:55.491
How in Neptune's creation
do you know all of
these names, SpongeBob?
海王星是如何创造的
你知道全部吗
这些名字，海绵宝宝？

17:55.574 --> 18:00.120
Well, I simply compile the name
of every customer in this book.
好吧，我简单编一下名字
本书中的每一位客户。

18:00.204 --> 18:01.205
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

18:01.288 --> 18:03.248
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

18:03.332 --> 18:08.253
Halpert, Norma, Isabelle, Gus,
Chaz, Pilar, Dennis, Kira,
Ivy, Marv, Mable, Mavis.
哈尔珀特、诺玛、伊莎贝尔、格斯、
查兹、皮拉尔、丹尼斯、基拉、
艾薇、马夫、梅布尔、梅维斯。

18:10.297 --> 18:14.259
And your name
is Suzy Fish, correct?
还有你的名字
苏西·菲什是吗？

18:14.343 --> 18:21.558
Yes, and you'd also be correct
in saying you ruined my food
with your sweat, you nitwit!
是的，你也是对的
说你毁了我的食物
用你的汗水，你这个白痴！

18:21.642 --> 18:24.269
Mr. Krabs,
that's the last customer.
蟹老板先生，
那是最后一位顾客。

18:24.353 --> 18:25.687
Do I win?
我赢了吗？

18:25.771 --> 18:28.315
Uh, well, actually,
I wasn't keeping score.
呃，实际上，
我没有记分。

18:28.398 --> 18:32.861
But I'll just say that you
and SpongeBob are neck and neck
但我只想说你
和海绵宝宝不分上下

18:32.945 --> 18:37.282
and that mystery guy
over there'll be the tiebreaker.
还有那个神秘人
那边将进行决胜局。

18:37.366 --> 18:38.700
Uh, that's, uh...
呃，那个，呃……

18:38.784 --> 18:40.953
Oh, that's, I know him.
哦，原来如此，我认识他。

18:42.913 --> 18:45.999
He's the ticket to your prize.
他是你获得奖品的门票。

18:46.083 --> 18:47.960
Out of the way, loser.
走开，失败者。

18:48.043 --> 18:49.753
Um, hello.
嗯，你好。

18:49.837 --> 18:52.381
My name is Squidward.
我的名字是章鱼哥。

18:52.464 --> 18:55.425
Uh, so, what's your name?
呃，那么，你叫什么名字？

18:55.509 --> 18:57.469
What's it to you?
关你什么事？

18:57.553 --> 19:03.851
Um, it's just that I was going
to, um, enter your name
in our sweepstakes.
嗯，只是我要去
嗯，输入你的名字
在我们的抽奖活动中。

19:03.934 --> 19:05.310
So, what should I put down?
那么，我应该放下什么呢？

19:05.394 --> 19:07.729
First and last name?
名字和姓氏？

19:07.813 --> 19:08.939
Sure.
当然。

19:09.022 --> 19:11.316
Yeah, why don't you
write this on your form.
是的，你为什么不
将其写在您的表格上。

19:11.400 --> 19:15.070
What's it to you!
关你什么事！

19:15.153 --> 19:19.199
Now leave me alone.
现在别管我了。

19:19.283 --> 19:22.119
I see he wants
to play hard to get.
我看他想要
玩得来之不易。

19:22.202 --> 19:23.495
So be it.
就这样吧。

19:23.579 --> 19:25.372
I have ways of making
the likes of him talk.
我有办法制作
像他这样的人会说话。

19:25.455 --> 19:29.001
Uh, sir, you forgot your soda.
呃，先生，你忘记带苏打水了。

19:29.084 --> 19:30.961
I didn't order any soda.
我没有点苏打水。

19:31.044 --> 19:32.462
It's on the house.
就在房子上。

19:32.546 --> 19:34.590
What the barnacles
are you doing?
什么是藤壶
你在做什么？

19:34.673 --> 19:37.259
Oh, I'm sorry, I slipped.
哦，对不起，我滑倒了。

19:37.342 --> 19:38.886
Here, let me clean
that up for you.
来，让我打扫一下
这就是为你准备的。

19:38.969 --> 19:42.848
OK, there must be a nametag
or some form of I.D. in here.
好的，必须有名牌
或某种形式的身份证件在这里。

19:42.931 --> 19:44.349
I don't need your help.
我不需要你的帮助。

19:44.433 --> 19:45.392
I'm out of here.
我要离开这里了

19:47.269 --> 19:48.729
Hey, look up in the sky.
嘿，抬头看看天空。

19:48.812 --> 19:51.857
A giant meteor
is hurtling towards Earth.
一颗巨大的流星
正在冲向地球。

19:51.940 --> 19:52.608
Where?
在哪里？

19:52.691 --> 19:53.525
Oh, you'll see it.
哦，你会看到的。

19:53.609 --> 19:54.985
Just keep looking.
继续寻找吧。

19:55.068 --> 19:56.528
I can't see it.
我看不到它。

19:56.612 --> 19:59.239
Well, that's too bad, 'cause
I found what I was looking for.
嗯，那太糟糕了，因为
我找到了我要找的东西。

20:00.407 --> 20:02.117
Hey, come back here!
嘿，回来吧！

20:02.201 --> 20:03.285
Give me my wallet!
把我的钱包给我！

20:08.123 --> 20:09.374
Holy sea cow!
圣海牛！

20:09.458 --> 20:11.293
That hooligan ran a stop sign.
那个流氓闯了停车标志。

20:11.376 --> 20:14.546
Stop, thief!
站住，小偷！

20:14.630 --> 20:16.131
You know that guy?
你认识那个人吗？

20:16.214 --> 20:17.257
Hardly.
几乎没有。

20:17.341 --> 20:18.258
He stole my wallet.
他偷了我的钱包。

20:18.342 --> 20:19.384
What?
什么？

20:19.468 --> 20:21.219
That makes him a dual offender.
这使他成为双重犯罪者。

20:21.303 --> 20:23.472
Let's get him.
我们来抓住他吧。

20:31.480 --> 20:33.732
Finally, the moment of truth.
最后，关键时刻。

20:33.815 --> 20:36.276
Say goodbye
to anonymity, mister...
说再见
匿名，先生...

20:36.360 --> 20:37.527
Freeze, thief!
冻结，小偷！

20:37.611 --> 20:39.404
No, you don't understand.
不，你不明白。

20:39.488 --> 20:40.989
I only want the wallet for...
我只想要钱包...

20:41.073 --> 20:44.284
We know exactly why
you want it, wallet snatcher.
我们确切地知道原因
你想要它，抢钱包的人。

20:45.452 --> 20:46.995
This isn't as it seems!
这并不像看上去的那样！

20:47.079 --> 20:51.291
That's what you'll be saying
in the slammer, punk.
这就是你会说的
在猛击者中，朋克。

20:51.375 --> 20:54.962
His driver's license.
他的驾驶执照。

20:56.672 --> 20:59.257
At last, at last!
终于，终于！

20:59.341 --> 21:02.177
And your name is...
而你的名字是...

21:02.260 --> 21:04.554
Mr. "What Zit Tooya?"
“什么Zit Tooya？”先生。

21:04.638 --> 21:06.515
What kind of ridiculous
name is that?
哪有什么可笑的
名字是那个？

21:06.598 --> 21:08.308
It's my ridiculous name.
这是我可笑的名字。

21:08.392 --> 21:11.186
"What Zit Tooya."
“什么Zit Tooya。”

21:12.437 --> 21:13.939
That's enough of that ballyhoo.
那些大肆宣传就够了。

21:14.022 --> 21:17.651
But I didn't intentionally
do anything wrong.
但我不是故意的
做任何错事。

21:17.734 --> 21:22.030
Tell it to the judge,
law breaker.
告诉法官，
违法者。

21:25.534 --> 21:28.370
Only 364 days
and nine years left
只有364天
还剩九年

21:28.453 --> 21:34.292
until I exchange
this concrete tomb for a
multi-story ocean liner cruise.
直到我交换
这座混凝土坟墓
多层远洋客轮巡航。

21:34.376 --> 21:35.460
SpongeBob: Hey, Squidward.
海绵宝宝：嘿，章鱼哥。

21:35.544 --> 21:37.462
Squidward: SpongeBob.
章鱼哥：海绵宝宝。

21:37.546 --> 21:40.465
The boy and I just thought
we'd stop by and check on
our convict friend.
我和男孩只是想
我们会过来看看
我们的囚犯朋友。

21:40.549 --> 21:42.509
Call me what you may.
你可以怎么称呼我。

21:42.592 --> 21:48.307
Fact of the matter is,
I found out the mystery
customer's name first, so I win.
事情的真相是，
我发现了其中的奥秘
客户的名字在前，所以我赢了。

21:49.933 --> 21:51.643
I win, I win, I win,
I win, I win.
我赢了我赢了我赢了
我赢了，我赢了。

21:51.727 --> 21:53.311
Enjoy your prize.
享受你的奖品吧。

21:53.395 --> 21:55.313
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

21:55.397 --> 21:58.191
Tropical vacation, here I come!
热带度假，我来了！

21:59.317 --> 22:00.819
Vacation?
假期？

22:00.902 --> 22:02.446
Who said anything
about vacation?
谁说了什么
关于假期？

22:02.529 --> 22:04.114
What?
什么？

22:04.197 --> 22:06.908
In the brochure,
it specifically mentions
an ocean liner vacation.
在宣传册中，
它特别提到
远洋客轮假期

22:06.992 --> 22:09.494
Oh, you mean  that  brochure?
哦，你是说那本小册子吗？

22:09.578 --> 22:11.663
Well, that was the prize.
嗯，这就是奖品。

22:11.747 --> 22:16.334
The brochure was taking up
too much room in me drawers,
you know, so it's your prize.
宣传册已被占用
我抽屉里的空间太多了
你知道，所以这是你的奖品。

22:16.418 --> 22:18.253
You mean, no vacation.
你的意思是，没有假期。

22:18.336 --> 22:19.671
Nope, just the brochure.
不，只是小册子。

22:19.755 --> 22:22.049
Well, got to get back
to counting me loot.
嗯，得回去了
来数我的战利品。

22:22.132 --> 22:24.009
Enjoy your new prize, Squidward.
享受你的新奖品吧，章鱼哥。

22:24.092 --> 22:26.261
See you on the outside
in 10 years, buddy.
在外面见
10年后，伙计。

22:29.347 --> 22:30.932
Oh, well.
那好吧。

22:31.016 --> 22:35.437
At least I'll have some peace
and quiet for the next 10 years.
至少我会得到一些平静
并在接下来的10年里保持安静。

22:35.520 --> 22:37.022
Patrick: Hey, Squidward.
帕特里克：嘿，章鱼哥。

22:37.105 --> 22:43.779
Parcheesi?
帕奇西？

帕奇西？